Package: microjs8
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: W5DMH <w5dmh@example.invalid>
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/W5DMH/microjs8
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11),
 python3-pil,
 python3-numpy,
 python3-evdev,
 python3-sounddevice,
 python3-serial,
 fonts-dejavu-core,
 adduser,
 systemd-sysv
Recommends: hamlib-utils,
 chrony,
 gpsd
Description: MicroJS8 — JS8 transceiver for M5Stack CardputerZero
 A self-contained JS8 transceiver daemon targeting the M5Stack
 CardputerZero handheld. Provides receive-decode-display, directed
 messaging, mailbox, emergency beacon, and TX scheduling on the
 built-in 320x170 panel and matrix keyboard.
 .
 Drives the radio via hamlib's rigctld (TS-480 emulation for QDX,
 G90 driver for Xiegu, RTS-PTT for DigiRig). Audio capture and
 playback go through ALSA / PortAudio.
 .
 Installs to /usr/share/APPLaunch/ and registers as an APPLaunch
 application; the M5Stack launcher menu shows it as a tile.
 The systemd service auto-starts on boot.
